   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>throws exception of error code. As per <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CORE_10304\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf)\">[SWS_CORE_10304]</a>, this function does not participate in overload resolution when C++ exceptions are disabled in the compiler toolchain.</p></div>",
